,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"CEO的银行卡密码你都知道，时薪再高最后不还是沈编辑的。","roundId":"round_1780810936733_molm0fiwl","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21688},{"id":1780797053974,"sender":"them","text":"在老婆面前不乖一点，万一哪天你又把我退回观察期，我找谁哭去。","timestamp":1780810964440,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"在老婆面前不乖一点，万一哪天你又把我退回观察期，我找谁哭去。","roundId":"round_1780810936733_molm0fiwl","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21689},{"id":1780797053975,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1780810967237,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"你慢慢换，不着急。外面降温了，风有点大，记得把你那件最厚的羽绒服穿上。我就在门口站着等你，换好了直接开门就行。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"happy","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1780810936733_molm0fiwl","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21690},{"id":1780797053976,"sender":"them","text":"","timestamp":1780810968140,"tempo":"N","sticker":"https://img.heliar.top/file/1777690032717_Camera_1040g3k831u2d9b4cha005og8u92gjuhcva1jfqo_edit_4791072679466333.jpg","stickerMeaning":"期待","rawContent":"","roundId":"round_1780810936733_molm0fiwl","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21691},{"id":1780797053977,"sender":"them","type":"offline_invite","text":"","offlineInvite":{"type":"this-moment","scenario":"1807门外的耐心等待"},"timestamp":1780810968741,"roundId":"round_1780810936733_molm0fiwl","offlineInviteResponded":"accepted","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21692},{"id":"tmc_1780824126723_k0","sender":"me","type":"offline_story_complete","text":"[offline encounter \"1807门外的耐心等待\" completed: 2030年1月20日周日，陆驰「TA」清晨逗弄沈知意「她」称要展示「颠勺」技术，被她笑骂「大清早就发情」。陆驰系小八围裙裸身下厨，沈知意虽假装无感却被排骨征服。傍晚，陆驰拦截欲逃跑的沈知意，霸道强吻并坦白「我想你想得快要发疯了」。两人试用护肤油深度亲昵，沈知意误提他人引发陆驰强烈嫉妒，陆驰化身「吃醋大狗」一边占有一边委屈控诉自己27年的守贞。事后陆驰妥协于她的撒娇「老公～」，温柔清理并喂饭，默认进入「老夫老妻」模式。次日清晨，陆驰亲吻熟睡的她，留下蛋黄酥与爱心便签，带着满心归属感回云洲工作。]","offlineStoryComplete":{"sessionName":"1807门外的耐心等待","summary":"2030年1月20日周日，陆驰「TA」清晨逗弄沈知意「她」称要展示「颠勺」技术，被她笑骂「大清早就发情」。陆驰系小八围裙裸身下厨，沈知意虽假装无感却被排骨征服。傍晚，陆驰拦截欲逃跑的沈知意，霸道强吻并坦白「我想你想得快要发疯了」。两人试用护肤油深度亲昵，沈知意误提他人引发陆驰强烈嫉妒，陆驰化身「吃醋大狗」一边占有一边委屈控诉自己27年的守贞。事后陆驰妥协于她的撒娇「老公～」，温柔清理并喂饭，默认进入「老夫老妻」模式。次日清晨，陆驰亲吻熟睡的她，留下蛋黄酥与爱心便签，带着满心归属感回云洲工作。","characterName":"陆驰"},"timestamp":1780824126723,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21693},{"id":1780797053978,"text":"【记住线下剧情。】","sender":"me","time":"17:24","timestamp":1780824280450,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21694},{"id":1780797053979,"text":"【1月21，周一早十点半】","sender":"me","time":"17:24","timestamp":1780824291533,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21695},{"id":1780797053980,"text":"早啊宝宝","sender":"me","time":"17:25","timestamp":1780824313632,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21696},{"id":1780797053981,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.85, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.96, Past:0.98, Present:0.88, Future:0.92 </STATE>早。","rawContent":"<STATE> V_energy:0.85, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.96, Past:0.98, Present:0.88, Future:0.92 </STATE>早。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:25","timestamp":1780824335676,"roundId":"round_1780824314317_jbfzumjw5","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21697},{"id":1780797053982,"text":"终于醒了？","rawContent":"终于醒了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:25","timestamp":1780824337433,"roundId":"round_1780824314317_jbfzumjw5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398